- Headless: ranged shell spawn/radius/speed, two bodies caught in one blast, blast slide, self-immunity; lob arc, landing and 2 damage; five-shell power with staggered launch times (`0.00, 0.02, 0.09, 0.16, 0.23`), 8 s cooldown, three-body carpet; a shell hitting cover dies there and does not damage the body behind it.
