So the rectangle should not spin; it should float/bob vertically (or perpendicular) slightly, clone left and right, then dash quickly. "Similar to cascade error enemy except this one is moving" — cascade errors are yellow blocks with red exclamation marks that spread block-by-block. So the rectangle should be a blocky row formation advancing. Clones to left and right; dash quickly as a row. Our current design is close but has rotation and sweep. Need:
