- Parent rotates? no; remove all spin for kind 6 and kind 8. The eye stays upright.
- The triangle shards rotate (fine). Circle spins (fine). Rect no rotate, just bob.

Also "cloned another version of itself to the left and right" maybe only two clones (left and right) → row of 3, not 5. "it has cloned another version of itself to the left and right" singular left/right = 2 clones. Use `echoes` 2? That gives 3 blocks. But "row of enemies" implies more; the prior request said "row of enemies". 3 wide is a row. Could use 4 clones (2 each side) = 5 row. User says "cloned another version of itself to the left and right" likely at least two. Our current 4 clones (2 each side) is a good row and matches "left and right". Keep 4, but maybe transition: first wave two clones? Simpler keep 4. The visual is axis-aligned; no rotation. Good.

