The triangle now watches the swarm from a moving position rather than sitting behind it, so strafing around the fight no longer leaves it as a free stationary target.

If you want the parent to hang back further or press closer while its children attack, the `floatRing` band is the single knob, and it is easy to pair with a slightly slower `floatSpeed` so the mother reads calmer.
